{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#card-zh","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kubectl 是面向 DSH 的 Kubernetes 集群工具插件，通过注册 kubectl 工具并调用本机 shell 执行命令。它支持以 JSON 查询资源、查看资源详情与 Pod 日志、检查客户端版本和集群上下文，也可在确认后执行容器命令、应用或删除资源，并建立端口转发。适合需要在 DSH 中进行集群巡检、排障和部署操作的用户。需要本机安装并配置 kubectl 与 kubeconfig，可选设置路径、context、namespace 和超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:52-76","src/index.js:193-223"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#card-en","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-kubectl connects Kubernetes to DSH using local kubectl tools. It queries resources, describes them, reads Pod logs, runs commands, applies or deletes manifests, and forwards ports. Requires local kubectl and kubeconfig; context and namespace are configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:52-76","src/index.js:193-223"]}
