{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#feature-1","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kubectl 的功能「Kubernetes 资源查询」：通过 `kubectl_get` 查询资源，可按名称、标签、命名空间或集群筛选；默认返回 JSON，也可选择 wide 输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:55-76"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#feature-2","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kubectl 的功能「资源详情与 Pod 日志」：使用 `kubectl_describe` 查看资源详情，或用 `kubectl_logs` 读取指定 Pod 日志，并可限定容器、行数或 previous 日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:79-110"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#feature-3","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kubectl 的功能「集群版本与上下文」：调用 `kubectl_status` 查看 kubectl 客户端版本和当前集群信息，支持指定 kubeconfig context。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:180-190"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#feature-4","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kubectl 的功能「Pod 命令与清单操作」：通过工具在 Pod 容器中运行命令，或对文件中的 Kubernetes 清单执行 apply、删除指定资源。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:113-159"]}
{"unit_id":"WODE25500__dsh-kubectl#feature-5","repo":"WODE25500/dsh-kubectl","commit":"7bb8623b7a55a997c418235b78cfae1443a23a73","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kubectl 的功能「端口转发」：指定 Pod 的远端端口以及可选本地端口建立 kubectl port-forward，便于从本机访问集群内服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:162-177"]}
